WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Ideas need not wait. One idea, many possibilities.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Enter conversation mode. Make the conversation feel natural.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Voice input: Help me outline an implementation.
Recognized locally and added to the draft.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Replies unfold gradually, with smooth rendering and scrolling.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Independent sessions. Parallel progress, visible together.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Explore different ideas in branches. Resume from a key turn.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Make workflows visible. Connect the steps you repeat.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Extend capabilities on demand: skills, MCP, and memory.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Keep exploring across desktop, terminal, and mobile.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Pisper. One idea, many possibilities.
